('2f10c574-741f-4e78-b647-5379120483f5', 'Weather updated every minute by an automated sensor on the airport', 'That describes ASOS or AWOS. ATIS is a recorded broadcast, updated hourly or when things change.'),
('301b1abc-1ff6-4137-9639-f69fa57deda1', 'Static discharge that interferes with radio and navigation equipment', NULL),
('31f0e266-d19c-4131-a26d-3a2ecc5c4a14', 'Tingling in the fingers and lips and visual disturbance, with no other signs', 'Those are more characteristic of hyperventilation.'),
