('3dd20f01-3113-4263-9146-5aaaed73891e', 'It is limited to 25 foot-pounds of kinetic energy on impact with a person', 'That is Category 3.'),
('3dddc5af-4d06-4b2b-a8fd-4630a452ffee', 'Obtain a night waiver under 107.200 and keep a copy of it at the control station', 'Night waivers were eliminated in 2021; night flight is permitted with lighting and training.'),
('3ff67bb5-df9c-4d71-94b5-72049f526736', 'Only the aircraft''s serial number, position, and altitude, and nothing about the pilot', 'That omits the control station position, velocity, time mark and emergency status.'),
('4048f653-5542-4ddf-be5e-6b305b6497d3', 'Yes; every aircraft flown under Part 107 must be registered', NULL),
('40ef5c4c-8948-454b-8af1-ffd5bb36a743', 'Dividing responsibilities equally among all of the crew members', 'Equal division is not the goal; protecting essential tasks is.'),
