('4981b26d-e3fc-469d-b577-8fed0fa33c4e', 'The ability to hover in one fixed position using GPS and the compass', 'That is position hold, a navigation function rather than stability.'),
('4b250637-2a7d-4a29-add3-5e3e097a6299', 'Charge it slowly at a low rate to reset and rebalance the cells', 'Charging a swollen pack raises the fire risk.'),
('4d7019c7-1b93-4313-b959-85b590819b77', 'Clear roles and terminology, with only the remote pilot allowed to call a stop', 'Anyone on the crew should be empowered to call a stop.'),
('4d7bd051-c08c-47b9-8502-bebef1805427', 'It hovers in place where the link was lost until the battery runs out', 'It flies back, which is the problem.'),
('4e531cd4-4506-45f4-b709-572cbd6a283b', 'The manager of the airport that owns the surrounding airspace', 'Airports do not own airspace, and the airport manager does not authorize controlled airspace access.'),
