('4f66d54e-21dd-4469-a444-17027c204a71', 'Control degrades as the flight controller uses up authority compensating', NULL),
('4fd258f9-5e2b-4939-b56c-edbaa661c39c', 'A steady white light visible for at least 1 statute mile in all directions', 'The rule requires flashing anti-collision lighting, and the distance is 3 statute miles.'),
('51adeff7-995a-416b-8bbd-04489190bfdc', 'A VFR flight plan filed with the nearest Flight Service Station before each launch', 'No flight plan is required under Part 107.'),
('522a13ed-8854-448c-8900-5c0c7b03d597', 'GPS signal loss caused by solar activity', 'Solar activity is a rare cause.'),
('53bbd875-ce40-42af-b13a-f47fe44eda36', 'When the operation is solely for news gathering by an accredited outlet', '89.101 limits the exception to aeronautical research or showing compliance with regulations.'),
('5435a973-c299-4704-9bcf-7296014ee210', 'Launch briefly to get the client their shot, then land immediately afterward', 'A short flight in unsafe conditions is still an unsafe flight.'),
('5570c20f-9a9b-442d-9513-87e79bab30b3', 'You need a waiver, since automated flight is not permitted under Part 107 without one', 'Automated flight is permitted without a waiver.'),
('5725aec4-9164-4ba2-8f54-a91dbb62e993', 'Any person who has given verbal consent to the overflight before takeoff', 'Consent is not one of the exceptions. The rule does not care whether a bystander agrees.'),
('5cc83d23-29ce-43e4-9ad8-7525b25854f4', 'Remote pilot operating instructions for flying within its eligibility', NULL),
('5d8d5022-1545-4dea-bbb2-006f2deaea14', 'An area where Remote ID broadcasting is mandatory for all aircraft at all times', 'A FRIA is the exception to Remote ID, not a stricter version of it.'),
('5efffc4b-2c1a-4aa2-be05-6bb8ce733a7f', 'The prohibition on sustained flight over moving vehicles and their occupants', 'A beach crowd is not moving vehicles. The conduct itself is careless or reckless.'),
