('6823ec97-8d5c-47dd-8807-9b2bd7293eae', 'An area where aircraft without Remote ID may fly beyond visual line of sight', 'Inside a FRIA, aircraft without Remote ID must stay within visual line of sight.'),
('68b12cd7-5eb7-4d1a-9cbc-38770a934033', 'Manufacturing defects in airframes, motors, and batteries', 'Defects occur, but human factors dominate.'),
('696b765d-85d7-4fa2-b734-8940fe214cc0', 'Carbon monoxide exposure, corrected by moving to fresh, ventilated air', 'Carbon monoxide poisoning is a different mechanism with a different remedy.'),
('69af1777-a8cd-42b8-a129-530d9e0d8efb', 'The route is 1,207 nautical miles long from entry to exit', 'The digits are an identifier, not a distance.'),
('6d7c70c5-85ef-4e10-aa09-1d0da28ad274', 'It transmits over the internet through a network provider rather than by radio', 'Both methods broadcast by radio frequency.'),
('6d99f411-e29b-42a9-a99d-a37b1b787dda', 'It only increases propeller noise, with no measurable change in thrust or handling', 'Thrust and vibration are affected too.'),
('6df26a37-563a-4677-aeb6-a6b681ae4a03', 'Over an open-air assembly, provided Remote ID is broadcasting throughout the flight', 'Category 3 never permits operations over open-air assemblies.'),
('701e55a6-fc65-4c8b-a70d-3a06a8a35d9a', 'Lit towers, because their bright strobes destroy your night vision', 'Lit obstacles are the ones you can see and plan around.'),
('70c4fa93-76ba-47e0-a8fe-d486f806e313', 'Because Part 107 requires a designated landing site to be filed before flight', 'No landing site filing requirement exists.'),
('713a7038-cc25-4961-b056-553850cfbf96', 'Press it flat between two boards and keep flying it as normal', 'Compressing a damaged cell can start a fire.'),
('7142aae8-63f3-4fde-b4d0-f065a42892a5', 'It uniformly improves performance by sharpening alertness and focus for everyone', 'Mild arousal can help, but acute stress degrades judgment and scan.'),
('7276a6e1-e37b-424a-ba16-489b2b6ebae0', 'The aircraft is leaving the pattern and departing to the south of the field', 'Base leg is an arrival leg, not a departure.'),
('7384dcc5-4ddc-4372-a316-6a5b21f2a542', 'Observed fronts, pressure systems, and station data', NULL),
('77af17a8-b403-40b0-85fc-5068d43c9c6a', 'Smooth air, cumuliform clouds, showery precipitation, and poor visibility', 'Cumuliform clouds and showers mark unstable air.'),
('792bfd4f-2efa-4bb4-8bea-76354cc3ce74', 'Obstacle sensors always detect the trees and prevent the collision', 'Sensors can miss branches and fail in poor light or when not facing forward.'),
('7968e2e3-f49a-47a5-9fd2-cce3bc02474e', 'A permanently closed runway that may not be used for any operation', 'A closed runway is marked with a large X.'),
('7b712bb2-b413-42e5-8e46-ba06f9332419', 'Immediately cut power to the controller so the aircraft stops and lands where it is', 'Cutting the transmitter usually triggers the lost link behaviour rather than a landing.'),
('7dac5bc2-02e2-4916-883b-cda20a56b887', 'The battery percentage is calculated only once, at takeoff, and never updated', 'Battery state is monitored throughout flight.'),
('7e1c49a5-6283-4d4a-82bb-9cbe71b547ff', 'That the total is under 55 pounds and the center of gravity is recorded in a log', 'No log is required. The manufacturer''s maximum takeoff weight is the limit that matters here.'),
('7fd90fb5-6b25-4bfd-9b41-47f0abc1bce8', 'A notice issued only for military airspace and training activity', 'NOTAMs cover civil and military information alike.'),
('80a9e188-7023-4c80-8e8a-1ff674fb7f71', 'The control link is lost at the same moment, since both share one radio', 'GPS and the control link are separate systems and fail independently.'),
('815736c3-3621-44a5-a649-7c1e0ebd3ddf', 'It changes flight control and battery behaviour, so update well before a job', NULL),
('837431f9-2439-49a0-9206-9d76f114acfb', 'A continuous watch on the aircraft and airspace while the pilot flies', NULL),
('8419037e-078c-4ac4-a6d0-9eb703c5ad64', 'Only the FAA Administrator or an NTSB representative may lawfully demand to see it', 'Federal, State, and local law enforcement and TSA representatives may also request it.'),
('85f42df8-23b3-41cf-a4b4-f43ed871c272', 'Keeping the aircraft close enough to see its orientation at all times', 'Close range helps you keep the aircraft and its orientation in view.'),
('8611eaea-c193-424d-abf6-8cf7c11c00b8', 'Part 107 requires the latest firmware to be installed before every commercial flight', 'Part 107 imposes no firmware requirement.'),
('8629ff92-8106-465d-9116-55e327bb99e4', 'The aircraft immediately shuts down its motors and descends to the ground', 'Aircraft do not cut power on GPS loss; they revert to attitude-stabilised flight.'),
('87fabf27-c88f-4e6f-9337-e0449bb01ead', 'Have an FAA-certificated repair station inspect the aircraft once a year', 'No annual inspection exists. Follow the manufacturer''s maintenance guidance.'),
('88c09ced-01a9-4015-84ed-0fa3220a9b9a', 'You may fly after first obtaining a third-class medical certificate from an AME', 'Part 107 requires no medical certificate of any class.'),
('8b0eae94-46a4-485f-80c3-af067c65d553', 'Authorization from Air Traffic Control through LAANC', 'ATC authorization covers controlled airspace, not restricted areas.'),
('8cbe4469-0630-4d29-9d0a-4143933bf61c', 'A consumer smartphone weather application with hourly forecasts', 'Consumer apps report neither ceilings nor aviation visibility.'),
