('94520c87-52bd-4e8e-b712-e4c822e31ddc', 'Using all available resources, including crew, equipment, and information', NULL),
('94fd5d71-5fa6-4ffe-9fc5-f208afc41593', 'Local weather and airspace, plus a written weight and balance computation for the flight', '107.49 requires assessing weather, airspace, and people and property on the surface. No weight and balance computation is mandated.'),
('9592a9d1-8700-4863-be38-002dd6a7edd7', 'Local weather, airspace and flight restrictions, and people and property below', NULL),
('96c1225f-5b6a-4ca7-b099-3278f5cdd97c', 'Restricted areas are active 24 hours a day, every day, without any exception', 'Activity times are published on the chart panel; many are not continuously active.'),
('9720d34c-f81a-437c-9ae1-b16159dafd4d', 'ADS-B In receivers are prohibited, but ADS-B Out may be used in any airspace', 'This is exactly backwards. Receiving is fine; transmitting is prohibited.'),
('97a65c3c-42e1-40f3-83f0-268bc03417e3', 'Airspace where all flight is permanently prohibited by regulation', 'Permanent prohibition describes a prohibited area.'),
('98362079-f7b0-4e3d-9ca1-6ed440d2bdbe', 'A bright white headlamp worn throughout the flight', 'Bright white light destroys dark adaptation.'),
('98eb8d99-3d3b-47e3-a0b4-86482617fc1c', 'Hold at least a third-class FAA medical certificate issued by an AME', 'No medical certificate is required.'),
('9d8c1904-8539-46b9-95eb-a775fc8fa990', 'A radar approach facility that issues drone airspace authorizations on request', 'Drone authorizations come through LAANC or the FAA DroneZone.'),
('9ddf0717-2dc5-41d3-a29b-a5b12b5caf95', 'Reduced lift, but longer flight time because the motors draw much less current', 'Thin air makes motors work harder and shortens flight time.'),
('9e028318-c6d1-44a3-9127-0dde85fcd3a3', 'It allows the remote pilot to operate two aircraft at the same time safely', '107.35 permits only one aircraft per person regardless of observers.'),
('9e6c1088-6f48-4365-9de4-3a08f42bde9e', '4.4 pounds or less, including the battery and any payload', '4.4 pounds is the registration threshold in some countries, not a Part 107 category limit.'),
('9e8e3160-2c2e-4bed-af8e-b041d93c5d1d', 'Interfering with operations and traffic patterns at towered airports only', 'The rule covers every airport, heliport, and seaplane base.'),
('9f8be0bb-7c3a-45f9-b34f-1c82f18133ec', 'A person inside a moving vehicle that has a hard metal roof', 'The exception covers a covered structure or a stationary vehicle. A moving vehicle is treated separately.'),
