('a63cb531-8fde-4fd7-83f4-0c8b2dc6d2a4', 'A required filing you submit before operating in controlled airspace', 'NOTAMs are information you receive, not a filing you submit.'),
('a6c9e14b-bc98-47a0-be4e-37745a0800c5', 'The maximum wind speed the aircraft can tolerate while holding a hover', 'That is a performance limit, not a definition of stability.'),
('a6e25c19-d7fc-4058-94d5-95e45bc30a95', 'At a towered field ATC sequences traffic; at a non-towered field pilots self-separate', NULL),
('a9967599-f580-4a6a-ad57-a8cc8fb815d0', 'At a towered field pilots self-separate; at a non-towered field ATC sequences traffic', 'That is backwards.'),
('a9a0a395-3b6c-44bd-acb8-7cb98425bbf9', 'Non-towered airports prohibit small unmanned aircraft within 5 statute miles of the field', 'No such blanket 5 mile prohibition exists under Part 107.'),
('ab674a87-a6e5-4721-81d2-b66e731b9402', 'Standard Remote ID, ADS-B Out, or a transponder set to the VFR code', 'ADS-B Out and transponders are prohibited under Part 107.'),
('ac041e67-74c4-4b13-902f-b4dee87eac9e', 'A flight plan filed with Flight Service and an assigned transponder squawk code', 'Part 107 requires no flight plan, and transponders are prohibited.'),
('ac144d82-0e37-4c39-ae21-4248101471d2', '55 pounds or less, including everything on board or attached', '55 pounds is the overall Part 107 definition of a small unmanned aircraft.'),
('ac63fda0-6ce6-43eb-b4b1-d88ed44dada0', 'Multiple category eligibility is not permitted for any one aircraft design', '107.150 expressly allows it, subject to the switching safeguard.'),
('acb57057-9780-408f-a3c3-8afd1eaa4b45', 'Calling the control tower by telephone to request clearance before each flight', 'Manual requests exist but are the exception; LAANC is the routine path.'),
