('af03455b-4363-469c-b799-9e481843269c', 'A separate declaration of compliance is needed for each flight and mode', 'Declarations cover the aircraft, not individual flights.'),
('afb75ddb-cd23-4bf7-bc1f-23f5c12f4607', 'A displaced threshold, usable for takeoff and for landing rollout only', 'A displaced threshold is marked with arrows, not chevrons.'),
('b01566ab-5841-4c64-a37d-0c29a9a6b276', 'It affects only inexperienced pilots who have not yet built up flight hours', 'Experience moderates stress but does not eliminate its effects.'),
('b13a0e00-29c5-46b6-84b7-5457b40cbc73', 'Notification to the airport operator at least 24 hours before each flight', 'Advance notification is a recreational flyer concept, not a Part 107 requirement.'),
('b15fd147-0c02-4abf-80f2-542158409fa7', 'Suspension or revocation of any certificate, authorization, or waiver held', NULL),
('b3d4a802-6702-4edd-9312-efe624ab563e', 'It increases, because the aircraft must produce extra thrust', NULL),
('b6f98980-adf5-490e-81e0-c48309eb7839', 'A broken layer at 800 feet MSL, forming a ceiling', 'METAR cloud heights are above ground level.'),
('b797ebc8-9cab-4b3d-8529-99624bab87d2', 'A warning letter only, since no flight took place and nobody was put at risk', 'No flight is needed. The falsified record is the violation.'),
('b8586d29-bd08-46c9-9434-62b6221a0d0b', 'Aircraft and control station position, velocity, time mark, and emergency status', NULL),
('b8993985-5628-4576-a65c-7c23730b4ab2', 'Wait exactly 24 hours after the first dose, then fly as you normally would', 'No fixed interval applies; effects vary by drug and individual.'),
('bc181774-20a7-40ce-84aa-7c4ee1b2aa0d', 'Scheduled manufacturer maintenance, logged and submitted to the FAA each year', 'Records are recommended but never submitted to the FAA.'),
('bc3e7b17-c3cd-49e2-bcee-78c4bd5d9587', 'The aircraft rolls continuously toward the heavy side until it lands', 'The controller can usually hold level, at a cost.'),
('bd57b74f-2063-41ed-890f-b914a38ebebe', 'Filing a flight plan with Flight Service, which then issues the authorization', 'Part 107 has no flight plan requirement and Flight Service issues no authorizations.'),
('be87ebea-7491-4765-b7ba-ab5eb440fa8d', 'Only endurance is affected, while handling and control stay the same', 'Center of gravity is a handling issue first.'),
('bec93bd5-cf6d-4bc1-b5e1-3181ad1dacec', 'Respect minimum voltage, and recharge packs while still warm to lower resistance', 'Let packs cool before recharging.'),
('bf8affec-b82a-48bf-9d94-b5aef674106b', 'It turns turbulent, with rotors and downdrafts on the downwind side', NULL),
('c094e300-896b-4bc3-8f87-e51cdb1df5ef', 'No effect at all, as long as total weight stays below the 55 pound regulatory limit', 'The regulatory limit is unrelated to how the aircraft performs.'),
