('c2b356f0-edc2-4269-81a0-37cd3de61da5', '3 statute miles, measured from the position of the small unmanned aircraft', 'The distance is right but the reference point is wrong; it is measured from the control station.'),
('c39c007b-c37f-4465-bd43-b9f36f6330c0', 'Increase altitude so the aircraft stays farther from the people below it', 'Greater altitude means more energy at impact and a wider dispersion area.'),
