('d350af82-b97e-485e-ab5c-d0db9967194e', 'No operation within 8 hours of consuming alcohol, or at or above 0.08 percent BAC', 'The limit is 0.04 percent.'),
('d3780257-86bf-4045-9920-92ce0abb120e', 'Nothing further; Category 2 eligibility on its own permits sustained flight over them', '107.145 imposes conditions on top of category eligibility.'),
('d40a339f-f40e-4589-bb7b-3b0a67b3c8ca', 'It has no effect on pilots who remain on the ground in the shade', 'Ground-based operation offers no protection from dehydration.'),
