('d9e9d7a4-8e87-4c79-ad09-0e8c2ec0d53c', 'Manufacturer maintenance, propeller and battery care, and firmware updates', NULL),
('dab40acc-8e40-4733-94e3-6b0017504c49', 'Carry a spare aircraft and spare parts to every job', 'A spare limits downtime but prevents no mechanical failure.'),
('dae13a5e-7c55-4b2d-acb9-e6a787c24973', 'Property may never be carried for pay under Part 107 without an exemption', 'Limited carriage for hire is allowed.'),
('dbb38867-71c3-4fd2-b81d-fae515ac0397', 'The rPIC may deviate only from the operating limitations listed in 107.51', 'The deviation authority covers any rule of the part, not one section.'),
('dd064189-eebf-4736-8416-d72c5dd0d2ba', 'Answer briefly while the aircraft holds a steady GPS hover overhead', 'Your attention belongs on the aircraft. Let crew handle bystanders.'),
('dd4d17e5-6e67-461c-894d-a84b9def63bd', 'Anti-collision lighting visible for at least 3 statute miles', NULL),
('dd7d2f8e-7ff4-4d7e-a88c-c2ee15e52276', 'They reveal failure patterns, so parts get replaced before they fail', NULL),
('de24a256-bc26-432e-a81c-33ade7a41eaa', 'A permanent, lifetime bar from ever holding any remote pilot certificate', 'The denial period is up to 1 year, not permanent.'),
('de873615-08f2-4a7c-bf24-74e6e1e47669', 'Less than 55 pounds, measured with batteries installed but excluding any payload', 'There is no payload exclusion; anything attached counts.'),
('deda011e-ffab-4f9b-910a-19e7d6824667', 'Each person below must carry a flashlight or wear reflective clothing', 'No such requirement exists.'),
('df672dac-8541-4252-a362-8783b8192490', 'A requirement to carry at least two qualified crew members on every commercial flight', 'Part 107 permits single-pilot operations; CRM is a practice, not a headcount rule.'),
('e06d792b-0f86-43a1-82c3-f5087dcc1e2c', 'As the minimum flight time available regardless of conditions', 'It is a maximum under ideal conditions, never a minimum.'),
('e0e80480-c062-479d-afca-fc78aad79fe7', 'Using a visual observer to assist with scanning the surrounding airspace', 'A visual observer improves situational awareness rather than degrading it.'),
('e1003d10-b383-4ccd-adca-875880cb54ba', 'Airframe, propellers, battery, control links, and payload security', NULL),
