('e2f38f4e-c8ce-4590-9953-453ca521a167', 'Insufficient oxygen at altitude, corrected by descending to a lower level', 'That describes hypoxia, which is not a factor below 400 feet AGL.'),
('e3485946-7b4e-4bc3-833d-7bf36bd019f0', 'A lasting change starting at 1600 local time', 'TAF times are UTC.'),
