('e59c5b90-a79f-48d9-8808-250c6ac25fce', 'Gradually lowering clouds and steady rain spreading well ahead of the front', 'That describes a warm front.'),
('e8305440-f43c-4809-ac54-2f515f574871', 'They are required to be submitted with each waiver or airspace application', 'Neither waiver nor airspace applications require maintenance records.'),
('e9f0b290-43e0-49c5-ae12-5f0b7c9cc809', 'A class of controlled airspace where drones require ATC authorization to enter', 'A TRSA is not one of the airspace classes and participation is voluntary.'),
('eb030c6b-62e8-42a9-a3b8-9ee89e99e1ca', 'It is required to be carried aboard the aircraft on every commercial flight', 'Nothing is carried aboard, and Part 107 imposes no such requirement.'),
('eb94211a-daf9-4306-b63b-8802d3cf3599', 'Air traffic control clearances and taxi instructions for departing aircraft', 'ATIS is non-control information only and issues no clearances.'),
